OverTheWire Bandit Challenge
As part of my Linux learning journey, I am working through the OverTheWire Bandit wargame. For each level, I will create a write-up documenting the objective, the commands used, the thought process behind the solution, and the key Linux concepts learned.

The goal is not only to complete the challenges but to build a deeper understanding of Linux fundamentals, including file operations, permissions, searching, networking, shell usage, and problem-solving techniques commonly used by system administrators and DevOps engineers.
